ally, we want to replace the proportionality symbol with an equality symbol. Let $k$ be a positive constant. Since the mass *decreases* with time, our derivative should be *negative*. Therefore, we can rewrite our proportionality statement as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}M}{\\text{d}t}=-k{M}^{2}.\n$$" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310456 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310457 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310458 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310459 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1000 #edb/ref 17592186310460 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1041 "selection" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1104 #edb/ref 17592186310457 13194139534792 true] [17592186310455 1110 #uuid "8f1b0ad4-b3f0-58ba-847e-112cee74785f" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310456 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}M}{\\text{d}t}=k{M}^{2},\\,\\,k>0" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310456 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534792 true] [17592186310456 1111 #uuid "9040d995-4b91-5e52-95f2-d5cb882a3dd0" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310457 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}M}{\\text{d}t}=-k{M}^{2},\\,\\,k>0" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310457 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534792 true] [17592186310457 1111 #uuid "f2c509b0-e6da-5199-994a-ce81c59fc86d" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310458 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}M}{\\text{d}t}=-kM,\\,\\,k>0" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310458 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534792 true] [17592186310458 1111 #uuid "82327f25-b37f-5b73-a9c3-1e5026b7b754" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310459 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}M}{\\text{d}t}=-k\\sqrt{M},\\,\\,k>0" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310459 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534792 true] [17592186310459 1111 #uuid "a0b2ef34-4c74-5b5f-b815-305fd9653851" 13194139534792 true] [17592186310460 1034 "\\frac{\\text{d}M}{\\text{d}t}=\\frac{k}{{M}^{2}},\\,\\,k>0" 131941395